CHORD_UniLab third-party provenance
===================================

UniLab
------
Project: https://github.com/Motphys/UniLab
License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)

The FlashSAC algorithms, asynchronous Torch collector/learner runtime, IPC,
off-policy logging, environment/observation contracts, training lifecycle,
Hydra entrypoints, and focused tests were derived from UniLab and are now
maintained independently in CHORD_UniLab.

Source revisions:
  UniLab origin/main: ce1a3296
  Reviewed integration snapshot: b5438e074f937cd593788c539f1131d9bb2dce16

Built-in actor checkpoints retain the persisted schema identifier
"unilab.rl.algos.flash_sac.network:FlashSACActor" for checkpoint compatibility.
This identifier does not introduce a runtime dependency on unilab.rl.

Historical lineage
------------------

Some runtime, placement, seed, and test module headers cite unilab_rl revision
3654e4b (unilab-rl 1.4.15), licensed under Apache-2.0. Those files entered this
project through UniLab's FlashSAC/runtime tree; the citation records their
original provenance.
